# ============================================================
# main.awi – AwiOS Engine Interactive Guide
# An assistant explains how the .awi engine works.
# ============================================================

SETTINGS
  id: main_01
  title: Interactive Guide
  story_name: AwiOS Engine
  story_id: main
  avatar: assets/images/tulip.png
  preview: Hello! I'm your guide to the AwiOS Engine. Tap to start.

THREADS
  grupo: Guide | start | A,P

CHARACTERS
  A: Assistant (#9C27B0) [assets/images/tulip.png]
  [Player] P: You (#2196F3) [assets/images/sunset_sky.png]

[start]
  type: chat
  A: Hello! Welcome to the AwiOS Engine — a lightweight narrative engine for phone simulators.
  P: Hi! How does it work?
  A: Everything is controlled by .awi scripts. Linear dialogue, choices, notifications, and more.
  next: linear_demo

[linear_demo]
  type: chat
  A: See: this is linear dialogue. Each message follows the previous until we reach a choice.
  P: Got it.
  A: We can also add images and videos directly in the chat bubble.
  image: assets/images/mountain_snow.png
  A: Like this mountain landscape. Tap to zoom!
  next: choice_demo

[choice_demo]
  type: choice
  A: Now a choice. What do you want to explore first?
  > See notifications -> path_notify {RECORD_PATH: path_notify}
  > Unlock gallery -> path_gallery {RECORD_PATH: path_gallery}
  > See everything -> path_full {RECORD_PATH: path_full}

[path_notify]
  type: chat
  A: Great! I'll trigger system notifications.
  system: trigger(app="instahub", action="post", id="p_tulip")
  system: toast(title="InstaHub", body="New photo in feed!")
  system: notify(title="AwiOS", body="Post unlocked in InstaHub.", app="messages")
  A: Open InstaHub (icon on the bar) to see the tulip post. The toast appeared at the top!
  next: gallery_demo

[path_gallery]
  type: chat
  A: I'll unlock some photos in the gallery.
  system: unlock(app="gallery", id="assets/images/sunset_sky.png")
  unlock_gallery: assets/images/mountain_snow.png
  system: notify(title="Gallery", body="New photos unlocked!", app="messages")
  A: Open the Gallery to see the images. Two photos were unlocked.
  next: final_msg

[path_full]
  type: chat
  A: Perfect! I'll demonstrate everything at once.
  system: trigger(app="instahub", action="post", id="p_tulip")
  system: trigger(app="instahub", action="post", id="p_sunset")
  system: unlock(app="gallery", id="assets/images/sunset_sky.png")
  unlock_gallery: assets/images/mountain_snow.png
  system: toast(title="AwiOS", body="InstaHub and Gallery updated!")
  A: InstaHub received two posts; the Gallery has two new photos. Explore the apps!
  next: final_msg

[gallery_demo]
  type: chat
  A: And the gallery? Each script can unlock photos with system: unlock or unlock_gallery.
  system: unlock(app="gallery", id="assets/images/tulip.png")
  system: notify(title="Gallery", body="New photo: tulip!", app="messages")
  A: The tulip was added to your gallery. Open the Gallery app to see it.
  next: final_msg

[final_msg]
  type: chat
  A: That was the interactive guide! You saw: linear dialogue, choices, and system commands (trigger, toast, notify, unlock).
  P: Cool! How do I create my own scripts?
  A: Use template.awi as a reference. All commands are documented there. Good luck!
  next: fim

[fim]
  type: chat
  A: Thanks for trying the AwiOS Engine. Press Run and create your stories!
